#cellar
(name *)        Cellar
(room *)
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
    You are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading
    east, and a crawlway to the south.  On the west is the bottom of a
    steep metal ramp which is unclimbable.
(from * go #east to #troll-room)
(from * go #south to #chasm2)
(narrate failing to leave * #up)
    The trap door has been barred from the other side.
(narrate failing to leave * #west)
    You try to ascend the ramp, but it is impossible, and you slide back down.

#troll-room
(name *)        The Troll Room
(room *)
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
    You are in a small room with passages off in all directions. 
    Bloodstains and deep scratches \(perhaps made by an axe\) mar the
    walls.
(from * go #west to #cellar)
(from * go #east to #crawl4)
(from * go #north to #passage1)
(from * go #south to #maze1)

#troll
(* is #in #troll-room)
(name *)        troll
(animate *)
(villain *)
(* combat strength is 2)
(appearance *)
    (if)~(* is asleep)(then)
        A nasty-looking troll, brandishing a bloody axe, blocks all passages
        out of the room.
    (else)
        An unconscious troll is sprawled on the floor.  All passages out of
        the room are open.
    (endif)
(descr *)
    (appearance *)
(prevent [leave #troll-room #east/#north/#south])
    (#troll is #in #troll-room)
    ~(#troll is asleep)
    The troll fends you off with a menacing gesture.

#axe
(name *)        bloody axe
(item *)
(weapon *)
(appearance *)  There is a bloody axe here.
