%%%

(narrate darkness)
    It is pitch black.  You are likely to be eaten by a grue.
    (notice #grue)

#grue
(name *)    lurking grue
%%TODO
(descr *)
    The grue is a sinister, lurking presence in the dark places of the
    earth.  Its favorite diet is adventurers, but its insatiable
    appetite is tempered by its fear of light.  No grue has ever been
    seen by the light of day, and few have survived its fearsome jaws
    to tell the tale.
(prevent [find *])
    There is no grue here, but I'm sure there is at least one lurking
    in the darkness nearby.  I wouldn't let my light go out if I were
    you!

%% TODO: can't get stuff if dark

%% Look at room after turning on light
(after [switch on $thing])
    ($thing provides light)
    (tick)
    (par)
    (try [look])

%%%

(understand [repent] as [repent])
(refuse [repent])
    It could very well be too late!

%% Not exactly like Zork
(list contents of $thing)
    (if){ ($thing is open) (or) ~(opaque $thing) }(then)
        (line)
        (list objects #in $thing)
        (list objects #on $thing)
        (list objects #under $thing)
    (endif)

%% Default rule - Look at a thing that is an openable container
(descr $thing)
    (container $thing)
    (openable $thing)
    (The $thing) is (if)($thing is open)(then)open(else)closed(endif).
    (list contents of $thing)

%% Melee

(instead of [attack $victim])
    (villain $victim)
    Attack with what?
	(asking for object in [attack $victim with []])

(perform [attack $victim with $weapon])
%%TODO
    You slash at (the $victim) with (the $weapon).

(jigs up)
    (game over { You have died })
    %%TODO

%% default item sizes

($thing size is 5)
    (item $thing)
